## Preferred architecture (revised)

**World tables first, managed club second.**

1. Resolve `game_plugin.dll` base + offset table (`tableRva` or signature fallback).
2. Walk People / Club / Team (and other slots as needed) → UID→pointer maps in &lt;2s.
3. **Then** attach the human manager → managed club → Club.Teams / TeamType for Squad UI.

Managed-club-first (GlassScout) + heap/idiom “player registry” burned tokens and still does not match FMLE. Mapping only the managed graph is the hard path; loading the world from known tables then selecting the managed club is the easy path.

Loop A today may keep the squad path until Loop D ships — do not rip production without a ticket. New world-index / registry RE **must** prefer table walk.

