## Field offsets (FMSuperScout Fields.cs ↔ FMT entity-map)

Provenance: CE tables (tdg6661), pinned FM **26.3.x** `game_plugin`. Player block = PLAO (person − dynamic class offset). FMT entity-map already aligned on most player fields.

| Field | FSS | FMT entity-map | Status |
|-------|-----|----------------|--------|
| UID | 0x0C | entityUid 12 | Match |
| isDatabaseOrigin | — | person+0xD5 (213) | Match (T216) — 1=DB, 0=regen; not youth bit 0x18 |
| CA / PA | 0x264 / 0x266 | 612 / 614 | Match — do not re-RE |
| Positions | 0x150 | 336 | Match |
| Attrs (×5) | 0x15F | 351 | Match |
| Height | 0x22E (u16) | 558 (u8 in map) | Verify width |
| First/Second/Common name | 0x50/58/60 | 80/88/96 | Match |
| Nation | 0x68 | 104 | Match |
| DOB | 0x88 | 136 | Match |
| Contract ptr | 0xA8 | 168 | Match |
| Loan (FMT) | — | person+176 | FMT-locked |
| Personality 0x70–0x77 | Adapt…Controversy | personPersonality 112 | Match |
| Wage / expiry | contract+0x20 / +0x48 | unmapped | Free win when ticketed |
| Team→club | 0x30 | teamClub 48 | Match |
| Team→competition | 0x50 | — | Available |
| Club.Teams begin/end | — | club+24/+32 | FMT-locked (T200) |
| TeamType | — | team+40 (0x28) | AppCake FM22→FM26 |

Person class dynamic offsets (FSS): Player `0x288`, PlayerStaff `0x380`, Staff `0x100`, HumanManager `0x450` — same idea as AppCake person-type split after walking People. FMT `playerPersonOffset` **648 (0x288)** = Player class; roster PLAO = person − class_offset. Some Team.Players slots are **non-person sentinels** (shared module vtable, fail all class offsets) — report honestly, do not treat as missing First XI.

