## Affiliations (public research — 2026-09-04)

**Verdict:** There is **no** open GitHub recipe with Main / Permanent / Players Move Freely **byte offsets** for FM26 (or earlier). Open tools never finished Club Affiliation entities. Closed editors (FMLE / FMRTE / tdg CE tables) own the write path. Semantic schema **is** public via FMLE UI strings; FMT’s live link scraps (`club+0x8E8`, link `club@0x160`) are ahead of OSS for Squad-tab reserves.

### What open source actually has

| Source | Affiliation content | Action |
|--------|---------------------|--------|
| AppCake `Relationship` / `RelationshipOffsets` | Person/club **favourites & rivals**. `Permanent` @ **0xD**, true = byte **79**. **Not** club affiliations. | Do not port for II/NPL |
| AppCake `ClubOffsets` | Teams / Nation / Finances — **no** affiliation vector | — |
| AppCake `Agreement` | Stub RowID/UID/Name only (nation-style agreements naming) | Thin |
| Jelmer `FmOffsets` | Slot **`AgreementOffset = 0x1A0`** on world table (counts scored 0–1000) | Prefer table walk when funded |
| FSS `Fields.cs` | CE-derived player/staff/team — **zero** affiliation fields | Confirms CE open dumps skip this |
| CE public posts | `vtbAgreement` = `db::AGREEMENT`; experimental “Add Club Affiliation” scripts | Closed CT field maps (Patreon) |
| FMLE free | Can **view** Affiliations; **Save Changes requires license** — free checkbox A/B does not write RAM (T214) | Paid A/B **or** static type compare |

### FMLE affiliation schema (ASCII/i18n in `fmle26.exe` — not offsets)

**Type enum labels (order as packed in binary):**  
Affiliated Club → Sub Team → Feeder Team → B Club → C Club → 2 Club → 3 Club → **II Club** → Good Relations → Likely Friendly → Shared Youth Club → Regional Academy → Extinct B/C Club → Women's Club → …

**Flag / benefit keys (UI):** `main`, `permanent`, `players_move_freely`, `players_go_on_loan`, `first_option_to_buy`, `same_board`, `uses_same_kit`, `financial_help`, `use_parent_facilities`, `sub_training_facilities`, `max_loan`, `play_friendlies`, `youth_training`, `scouting_knowledge`, `no_same_division`, `loan_players_from_sub`, …

Squad-tab reserves (Schalke II / Melbourne NPL class) are almost certainly **Type ∈ {B/C/2/3/II Club, Sub Team}**, not Feeder / Good Relations. Prefer locking the **Type byte** via static II-vs-feeder compare on the true affiliation record over name needles.

